      "mergedPostDetails": "It appears that vote to kick notifications are no longer showing on the notification page again. Friend requests appear to be working, as do invites, but the \"other\" tab shows nothing when there's a notification. It leaves the notification symbol stuck on your HUD, but no way of accessing the actual notification to vote and remove it.\nIt appears to be the same or similar to this bug that was previously fixed: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1046-bug-vote-to-kick-is-currently-broken-because-of-the-notifications-page",
